{
    "title": "Futorum H8 Digital watch face",
    "description": "The watch face has a simple high-tech style design for the best display of information and 30 day solar calendar (sunrise/sunset/twilight times).\r\n\r\n<b>Some of the functions of the watch face are available for free, \r\nFULL functionality available with a one-time in-app purchase.</b>\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#00A200\">This watch face is available on devices running Wear OS 2.4 and 3+ (API 28+), primarily the Samsung Galaxy Watch 4/5/6 & Google Pixel Watch.</font></b>\r\n<b><font color=\"#C10000\">Devises running Huawei Lite OS and Samsung Tizen NOT SUPPORTED.</font></b>\r\n\r\nThe watch face shows digital time, date, battery level, sunrise or sunset time, nautical twilight time, moon phase, moon illumination percentage, moonrise or moonset time, steps and distance traveled, heart rate and history of heart rate measurement.\r\n\r\nA unique watch face feature is a 30 day solar calendar (sunrise/sunset/twilight times).\r\nSolar calendar opens in window.\r\n\r\nAvailable in 7 color themes and 8 colors of time symbols.\r\nThere are two progress bars on the watch face - steps to the goal and battery level.\r\n\r\nIn the watch face settings, you can set the stride length according to your height. This will help for a more accurate calculation of the distance traveled.\r\n\r\nThe area containing alarm shortcut can be replaced with any app shortcuts you like. \r\n4 custom application shortcuts are available on the watch face rim.\r\nThe upper area for complications is not filled by default. \r\nCustomize it if necessary through the watch face menu.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udea9 IMPORTANT NOTES</b>\r\n\u2022 After installing the watch face, you need to install application shortcuts and complications widgets as you wish.\r\n\u2022 This watch face independently measures your heart rate. This watch face does not receive data from stock Wear OS heart rate apps. \r\n\u2022 All information about sunrise / sunset and moonrise / moonset, etc. is calculated by the watch face independently of stock apps.\r\n\u2022 To calculating the sunrise / sunset and moonrise / moonset you need to enable the \"Location\" option on both the watch and the smartphone.\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#00A200\">Functionality</font></b>\r\n\u2714 - <b>available for free</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 - <b>available with a one-time in-app purchase</b>\r\n\r\n<b>\u2705 TIME & DATE</b>\r\n\u2714 Digital time (12h and 24h modes)\r\n\u2714 Date, month, day of the week\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Day of the year, week of the year \r\n<b>\u2705 SUN & MOON</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Sunrise / sunset times\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Nautical twilight times (BMNT / EENT)\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Moonrise / moonset times\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Percentage of illumination and the name of the phase of the moon\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 30 day calendar (sunrise/sunset/twilight times)\r\n<b>\u2705 CUSTOMIZATION</b>\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 7 color themes\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 8 colors of time symbols\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 1 area for complication widget\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 5 customizable app shortcuts\r\n<b>\u2705 STEPS</b>\r\n\u2714 Steps count\r\n\u2714 Progress of steps towards the goal\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable goal of counting steps\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Ability to select an application to receive the number of steps\r\n<b>\u2705 MOVED DISTANCE</b>\r\n\u2714 Moved distance (km or miles)\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable stride length depending on your height\r\n<b>\u2705 HEART RATE</b>\r\n\u2714 Heart rate BPM\r\n\u2714 Color-coded heart rate indicator (low, normal, high)\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Automatic heart rate measurement\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 History of heart rate measurements\r\n<b>\u2705 MISC</b>\r\n\u2714 Battery level\r\n\u2714 Moon phase\r\n\u2714 Unread notification count\r\n\u2714 Handling system icons\r\n\u2714 Multilingual (supports more than 40 languages)\r\n\r\n\u27a1 We are in social media\r\n\u2022 Telegram - https://t.me/futorum\r\n\u2022 Instagram - https://instagram.com/futorum\r\n\u2022 Facebook - https://facebook.com/FutorumWatchFaces\r\n\u2022 YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/c/FutorumWatchFaces\r\n\r\n\u2709 If you have any questions, please contact us by e-mail support@futorum.com\r\nWe will be happy to assist you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The watch face has a simple high-tech style design for the best display of information and 30 day solar calendar (sunrise/sunset/twilight times).<br><br><b>Some of the functions of the watch face are available for free, <br>FULL functionality available with a one-time in-app purchase.</b><br><br><b><font color=\"#00A200\">This watch face is available on devices running Wear OS 2.4 and 3+ (API 28+), primarily the Samsung Galaxy Watch 4/5/6 &amp; Google Pixel Watch.</font></b><br><b><font color=\"#C10000\">Devises running Huawei Lite OS and Samsung Tizen NOT SUPPORTED.</font></b><br><br>The watch face shows digital time, date, battery level, sunrise or sunset time, nautical twilight time, moon phase, moon illumination percentage, moonrise or moonset time, steps and distance traveled, heart rate and history of heart rate measurement.<br><br>A unique watch face feature is a 30 day solar calendar (sunrise/sunset/twilight times).<br>Solar calendar opens in window.<br><br>Available in 7 color themes and 8 colors of time symbols.<br>There are two progress bars on the watch face - steps to the goal and battery level.<br><br>In the watch face settings, you can set the stride length according to your height. This will help for a more accurate calculation of the distance traveled.<br><br>The area containing alarm shortcut can be replaced with any app shortcuts you like. <br>4 custom application shortcuts are available on the watch face rim.<br>The upper area for complications is not filled by default. <br>Customize it if necessary through the watch face menu.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udea9 IMPORTANT NOTES</b><br>\u2022 After installing the watch face, you need to install application shortcuts and complications widgets as you wish.<br>\u2022 This watch face independently measures your heart rate. This watch face does not receive data from stock Wear OS heart rate apps. <br>\u2022 All information about sunrise / sunset and moonrise / moonset, etc. is calculated by the watch face independently of stock apps.<br>\u2022 To calculating the sunrise / sunset and moonrise / moonset you need to enable the &quot;Location&quot; option on both the watch and the smartphone.<br><br><b><font color=\"#00A200\">Functionality</font></b><br>\u2714 - <b>available for free</b><br>\ud83d\udcb2 - <b>available with a one-time in-app purchase</b><br><br><b>\u2705 TIME &amp; DATE</b><br>\u2714 Digital time (12h and 24h modes)<br>\u2714 Date, month, day of the week<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Day of the year, week of the year <br><b>\u2705 SUN &amp; MOON</b><br>\ud83d\udcb2 Sunrise / sunset times<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Nautical twilight times (BMNT / EENT)<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Moonrise / moonset times<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Percentage of illumination and the name of the phase of the moon<br>\ud83d\udcb2 30 day calendar (sunrise/sunset/twilight times)<br><b>\u2705 CUSTOMIZATION</b><br>\ud83d\udcb2 7 color themes<br>\ud83d\udcb2 8 colors of time symbols<br>\ud83d\udcb2 1 area for complication widget<br>\ud83d\udcb2 5 customizable app shortcuts<br><b>\u2705 STEPS</b><br>\u2714 Steps count<br>\u2714 Progress of steps towards the goal<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable goal of counting steps<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Ability to select an application to receive the number of steps<br><b>\u2705 MOVED DISTANCE</b><br>\u2714 Moved distance (km or miles)<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Configurable stride length depending on your height<br><b>\u2705 HEART RATE</b><br>\u2714 Heart rate BPM<br>\u2714 Color-coded heart rate indicator (low, normal, high)<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Automatic heart rate measurement<br>\ud83d\udcb2 History of heart rate measurements<br><b>\u2705 MISC</b><br>\u2714 Battery level<br>\u2714 Moon phase<br>\u2714 Unread notification count<br>\u2714 Handling system icons<br>\u2714 Multilingual (supports more than 40 languages)<br><br>\u27a1 We are in social media<br>\u2022 Telegram - https://t.me/futorum<br>\u2022 Instagram - https://instagram.com/futorum<br>\u2022 Facebook - https://facebook.com/FutorumWatchFaces<br>\u2022 YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/c/FutorumWatchFaces<br><br>\u2709 If you have any questions, please contact us by e-mail support@futorum.com<br>We will be happy to assist you!",
